{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8cdf8f51-2cae-8176-bd0a-c4ff22274a0d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T12:12:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carmen Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:10:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, how can I help you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:10:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Beth. Um, I think I'm calling about the scholarship for class fees? I sort of saw it mentioned on the program flyer, maybe at the library."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:10:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, we do have financial assistance for our classes. It's an application form, and you'd turn it in to our office so we can look it over. Is this for you or for someone in your household?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:10:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's for me, I think. Maybe a pottery class and possibly the swim program, but I'm not totally sure which ones qualify."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:10:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. I'd say most of our regular classes are covered, but the form will list what's included. If something isn't, we'll tell you when we review it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:10:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that sounds sort of reasonable. Is the form online, or do I need to pick it up there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:11:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. You can print it from the city website under Recreation, or I can have a copy waiting at the front desk for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:11:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think I already printed one, actually. Hang on, I have it here. [pause] Oh, no. There's a typo right at the top. It says \"Applicaton.\" Missing an i."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:11:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no. Is it really? Well, don't worry, it's still the right form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:11:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, I'm a proofreader, so I sort of can't unsee it. It's fine, it's fine. I'll just fill it out as is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:11:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally understand. I'll pass it along so somebody can fix it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:11:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. So, what are your office hours, maybe, for dropping it off? I'm only dropping off the form, nothing else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:11:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open Monday through Friday, eight-thirty to four-thirty. You can just hand it to whoever is at the front desk, or leave it with me if I'm around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:12:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eight-thirty to four-thirty, okay. And I think the lunch hour is fine too? Like, someone's there at noon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:12:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, we keep the desk covered over lunch, so you're good any time in those hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:12:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And do I need to include anything with it, like proof of income, maybe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:12:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The form spells out what to attach. Read through the instructions on the second page and it should list everything. If you're unsure, bring what you have and we'll tell you if anything's missing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:12:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll do that. I think that's all I needed. Thank you, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:12:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Carmen! Have a great afternoon, and we'll see you soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:12:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
